<title>UK: British Telecom to make international move.</title>
<headline>British Telecom to make international move.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Telecom Plc said it planned a news conference in London on Thursday morning in connection with &quot;an announcement with international dimension&quot;.</p>
<p>The meeting would be held at 0930 GMT (1030 local).</p>
<p>BT is one of a number of groups mentioned as possible candidates to team up with French diversified utility group Cie Generale des Eaux which plans its own announcement of an international deal later today.</p>
<p>The company said in Paris on Wednesday that it would hold a news conference at 0900 GMT today.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
